<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss July car imports rise 3.6 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Swiss July car imports rise 3.6 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss car imports rose by 3.6 percent in July to a provisional 25,058 cars from 24,180 in the same 1996 month, the Swiss Car Importers Association said on Monday.</p>
<p>  Leading exporters	    July 1997	   July 1996</p>
<p>    Germany			  11,813	    11,945</p>
<p>    France			    3,788	     2,862</p>
<p>    Italy			     1,568	     2,217</p>
<p>    Japan			     5,133	     4,213</p>
<p>    Sweden				596		 779</p>
<p>    Britain			     398		 396</p>
<p>    Korea				 416		 300</p>
<p>--Zurich Newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
